# EsiFit — always-on project guidance

This repository is **EsiFit**. Before writing or changing any code, load and follow the **esifit-development** skill (`.cursor/skills/esifit-development/SKILL.md`).

That skill is the global, project-wide control plane for:

- Required reading order (`PROJECT_RULES.md`, `DESIGN_BIBLE.md`, inventory, data model, flags, decisions, testing, security, operations)
- Phase prompts and Definition of Done
- UI quality gate and documentation sync rules

Do not invent design tokens, duplicate components, or reverse logged product decisions. Prefer living docs at the repository root over stale copies.
